WHEN the system generates the advisory;
THEN it shall include all required elements (summary, versions, caveats, workarounds, CVE) and publish it on a dedicated security page or mailing list.'}, {'id': 'VULN-REQ-04', 'category': 'Security', 'text': 'The system shall allow researchers to provide PGP keys for encrypted communication, and shall store and use these keys only for secure, authenticated communication with the research team.', 'rationale': 'Protects sensitive information during the disclosure process and ensures secure exchange of data between researchers and internal teams.', 'acceptance_criteria': 'GIVEN a researcher submits a PGP key;
WHEN the system receives it;
THEN it shall validate the key and allow encrypted communication only with that key, and shall not store or use it for any other purpose.'}, {'id': 'VULN-REQ-05', 'category': 'Non-Functional', 'text': 'The system shall provide a mechanism for researchers to request a reward or recognition, and shall offer non-monetary incentives such as discounts, swag, or public acknowledgment.', 'rationale': 'Encourages positive researcher engagement and reinforces a culture of proactive security testing without financial risk.', 'acceptance_criteria': 'GIVEN a researcher has reported a vulnerability professionally;
WHEN the system evaluates the report;
