WHEN the transit provider of that AS is confirmed to perform SAV;
THEN the system shall allow the prefix to be accepted without additional validation.'}, {'id': 'SEC-003', 'requirement': 'The system shall protect its own components (e.g., ROA and IRR management systems) from compromise by implementing security hardening measures consistent with industry best practices.', 'rationale': 'Compromise of ROA or IRR management systems can affect the operation and performance of source address validation methods, as stated in the source material.', 'acceptance_criteria': 'GIVEN a potential attack vector targeting the ROA or IRR management system;
