[{'id': 'SEC-001', 'requirement': 'All internal workstations and servers shall use private IP addresses from the 192.168.0.0/16 block as defined in RFC 1918.', 'rationale': 'Private IP address space allows enterprises to operate internal networks without consuming global IP address space, reducing routing overhead and supporting scalability within the enterprise.', 'acceptance_criteria': 'GIVEN a workstation or server in the retail chain network;
