[{'id': 'SRS-SEC-001', 'requirement': "The DHCP server shall only assign IP addresses to clients that are on the same subnet as the server, and shall validate that the client's MAC address is not already in use.", 'rationale': 'Prevents IP address conflicts and ensures network stability by enforcing subnet boundaries and client uniqueness.', 'acceptance_criteria': 'GIVEN a client with a known MAC address on a subnet;
WHEN it requests an IP address;
