[{'id': 'SEC-001', 'category': 'Security', 'text': 'The NETCONF protocol shall use transport-level authentication, integrity, and confidentiality to protect configuration data in transit.', 'rationale': 'Ensures confidentiality and integrity of configuration data as per IETF RFC 6241, which mandates secure transport for protocol operations.', 'acceptance_criteria': 'GIVEN a network device configuration operation via NETCONF;
WHEN data is transmitted over the transport layer;
