THEN the CI/CD pipeline shall fail if any known vulnerabilities are detected, regardless of whether the code was generated by AI or a human.'}, {'id': 'SEC-004', 'category': 'Non-Functional', 'requirement': 'The system shall maintain an internal allowlist of approved packages for the organization, and only allow installation of packages that are on this allowlist or have been verified through public registry checks.', 'rationale': 'An allowlist provides a centralized, auditable list of trusted packages, reducing the risk of installing malicious or unknown packages via AI suggestions.', 'acceptance_criteria': 'GIVEN a package name suggested by the AI agent;
