[{'id': 'SEC-01', 'category': 'Security', 'text': 'Every AI-generated code change shall be reviewed and approved by a human developer before merging into the codebase.', 'rationale': 'Ensures human accountability and prevents deployment of unverified code, aligning with the principle that developers, not AI tools, are responsible for code correctness and security.', 'acceptance_criteria': 'GIVEN a code change generated by an AI tool;
