[{'id': 'SEC-01', 'category': 'Security', 'text': 'The email submission server shall require STARTTLS encryption for all connections to prevent interception of message content and credentials.', 'rationale': 'STARTTLS ensures that data in transit is encrypted, protecting against eavesdropping and man-in-the-middle attacks during submission.', 'acceptance_criteria': 'GIVEN a mobile client connects to the submission server via SMTP;
