[{'id': 'SEC-001', 'requirement': 'The system shall use the Message Submission Protocol defined in RFC 6409 for accepting email submissions, and shall operate over port 587.', 'rationale': 'RFC 6409 specifies that message submission should use a protocol distinct from message relay, and port 587 is the standard port for secure submission over TLS.', 'acceptance_criteria': 'GIVEN a user attempts to submit an email via the web interface;
