[{'id': 'SPF-REQ-001', 'type': 'functional', 'description': 'A domain administrator shall publish an SPF record in DNS to explicitly authorize specific hosts that are permitted to use the domain name in the MAIL FROM or HELO/EHLO commands of email messages.', 'rationale': 'Prevents unauthorized hosts from using a domain name in email headers, reducing the risk of email spoofing.', 'acceptance_criteria': "GIVEN a domain administrator publishes an SPF record in DNS;
